# Recipe for script/combat/dexxer-basic.razor. Build it with: python3 util/build-scripts.py
# Every setting of this loop: python3 util/build-scripts.py --settings recipe/dexxer-basic-recipe.razor
# @ output script/combat/dexxer-basic.razor


# ========================================================================================
# @ header
# ========================================================================================

# Minimal dexxer sustain: bandages, heal, cure and Refresh potions, the trapped pouch, gold drop and food.
# Needs: bandages, potions and their Drink hotkeys, Bandage Self, Clear Scavenger Cache.
# Melee and targeting stay manual. No Magery: the spell parts of the cure and heal blocks are off.
# Stat potions are not in this loop. Add buff/potions and fight/target to drink them in a fight.


# ========================================================================================
# @ blocks
#
#   One box per block, in the order the blocks run, base first. The builder writes the box.
#   Yours are the "> " lines in it (a note on the block, or under a setting the reason for
#   its value) and the @setvar! lines under it. Write a new @setvar! line under any box, its
#   reason as a "#" line right above it: the builder moves both to the box it belongs to.
# ========================================================================================

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ use base
#
#   The frame of every loop. Every recipe lists it first.
#
#   use_magery (default 1)
#      1 uses Magery: the Cure and heal agents, the reagent reads and the buffs. At 0
#      potions and bandages still go out.
#      Read by recovery/reagents, recovery/cure, recovery/heal.
#      > No Magery in this template.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@setvar! config__use_magery 0

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ use recovery/reagents
#
#   Reagent flags for the Magery casts, read on a clock and right after a refusal.
#   > The cure and heal blocks read its flags. With Magery off it reads nothing.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ use recovery/pouch
#
#   The trapped pouch while paralyzed, the one thing that can act then.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ use recovery/cure
#
#   Cure potion first, then the Smart Heal/Cure agent when none is carried.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ use recovery/heal
#
#   Heal potion at heal_hits, else Greater Heal at emergency_hits.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ use recovery/bandage
#
#   Self bandage while hurt or poisoned, never over a running one.
#
#   heal_skill_min (default 0)
#      Healing must be above this to bandage. At or below it recovery/light-heal stands
#      in.
#      > Healing must be above 10, as before the module build.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@setvar! config__heal_skill_min 10

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ use recovery/refresh
#
#   Total Refresh at or below refresh_stam.
#
#   refresh_stam (default 15)
#      Current stamina at or below this drinks a Refresh.
#      > Refresh only when nearly out of stamina, below 5 as before.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@setvar! config__refresh_stam 4

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ use pack/gold-drop
#
#   Drops gold at your feet while over max weight, one drop per pass.
#
#   gold_drop_amount (default 2000)
#      Gold dropped per pass while over max weight. Gold is cheaper than the leather.
#      > 500 per drop, as before.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@setvar! config__gold_drop_amount 500

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ use buff/food
#
#   Eats from a tray while Food Satisfaction is missing, looked at once a minute.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ use pack/scavenger
#
#   Clears the Razor scavenger cache every 30 seconds.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


# ========================================================================================
# @ setup
# ========================================================================================

# The codex hotbar, opened once when it is not up.
if not gumpexists 2016719803
    say "[codexhotbar"
endif
